.TH tine-pages 1  "pages " 
.SH NAME
tine\-pages \- List pages, or the pages at or under a namespace
.SH SYNOPSIS
\fBtine pages\fR [\fB\-\-namespace\fR] [\fB\-\-debug\fR] [\fB\-g\fR|\fB\-\-graph\fR] [\fB\-\-json\fR] [\fB\-h\fR|\fB\-\-help\fR] 
.SH DESCRIPTION
List pages, or the pages at or under a namespace
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
\fB\-\-namespace\fR \fI<NAMESPACE>\fR

.TP
\fB\-\-debug\fR
Enable diagnostic logging for the desktop app
.TP
\fB\-g\fR, \fB\-\-graph\fR \fI<GRAPH>\fR
The graph. Defaults to $TINE_GRAPH, else the graph folder around the current directory
.TP
\fB\-\-json\fR
Print the typed result (schema tine.cli/1) as JSON
.TP
\fB\-h\fR, \fB\-\-help\fR
Print help
